// UI themes (Mark 2026-11-08: the whole UI gets a swappable theme; nothing hardcoded in the panels).
// Every panel, HUD element and menu reads its colours, fonts, corner radii and textures from the
// active theme through UiTheme / UiStyle (Code/UI/Theme). Swap with the `ui_theme <id>` console
// command (saved per machine in FileSystem.Data/ui_theme.json) or change "defaultTheme" here.
// Colours: "#rrggbb", "#rrggbbaa" or "r,g,b[,a]" in 0–1. Sizes are 1080p design pixels — the
// ScreenPanel's AutoScreenScale scales them with the window / fullscreen height.
